rdinated reshaping' reading. Structural safeguards remain intact: Senate opposition majority (~59/81), Constitutional Court (Pavel appointments locked in approximately a decade), PR system preventing supermajority, EIU full democracy baseline established under Fiala. Autumn 2026 Senate elections and July Ankara NATO summit remain the primary near-term institutional checkpoints.",
